    "effect": "Effect: Your Pokémon may \"Take a Breather\" as a Free Action, even if they are Confused or Enraged, and they do not Trip or have to Shift away from enemies as part of the action. You may choose whether or not your Pokémon resets their Combat Stages to default. Your Pokémon heals Hit Points equal to the sum of your Athletics and Focus Ranks.\n\nBonus: When your Pokémon is healed by a source other than Shrug Off, they heal bonus HP equal equal to the higher of your Athletics and Focus Ranks.",
